[
  {
    "content_id": "10022001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;这是所罗门的歌，是歌中最美妙的歌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;深深地吻我吧！ 因为你的爱情比美酒更香甜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你的膏油芬芳怡人， 你的美名馨香四溢， 如同倒出来的香膏， 难怪少女们都爱慕你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你带我走，让我们一起奔跑吧！ 王啊，把我带进你的寝宫吧！ 我们为你欢喜快乐， 我们要颂扬你那胜似美酒的爱情。 难怪少女们都爱慕你！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的少女啊！ 我虽然黑似基达的帐篷， 却美如所罗门的锦帐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;不要因为我被太阳晒黑就看不起我。 这是因为我的兄弟恼恨我， 要我在烈日之下看守葡萄园， 使我无暇照顾自己。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我心爱的人啊，告诉我吧， 你在哪里牧羊？ 中午带羊去哪里歇息？ 我何必在你同伴的羊群旁游荡， 像风尘女子一样呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;绝色佳人啊！ 要是你不知道， 就跟着羊群的足迹， 到牧人的帐篷边喂养你的山羊羔吧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我的爱人啊， 你好比法老战车上套的牝马。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;耳环辉映你妩媚的脸颊， 珠链轻衬你美丽的颈项。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我们要为你打造镶有银珠的金饰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;王坐席的时候， 我身上的哪哒香膏芬芳四溢。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我的良人在我眼中， 好像我怀中的一袋没药。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我的良人在我眼中， 好像隐·基底葡萄园中的凤仙花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我的爱人啊！ 你真是美极了！美极了！ 你的双眸好像鸽子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我的良人啊！ 你真英俊！真可爱！ 我们以青草作床榻，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;以香柏树作屋梁， 以松树作椽子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我是沙仑平原的玫瑰花， 是谷中的百合花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我的爱人在众少女中， 就像荆棘中的一朵百合花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我的良人在众男子中， 好像林中的一棵苹果树。 我欢欢喜喜地坐在他的树荫下， 轻尝他香甜可口的果子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他带我走进宴席大厅， 众人都看见他对我充满柔情爱意。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;请用葡萄干来补充我的力气， 用苹果来提振我的精神， 因为我思爱成病。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他的左手扶着我的头， 他的右手紧抱着我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的少女啊！ 我指着羚羊和田野的母鹿吩咐你们， 不要叫醒或惊动爱情， 等它自发吧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;听啊！是我良人的声音， 他攀过高岗，跃过山丘， 终于来了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我的良人好像羚羊和幼鹿。 看啊，他就在墙外， 正从窗户往里观看， 从窗棂间往里凝视。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;他对我说： “我的爱人，起来吧！ 我的佳偶，跟我来！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;你看！冬天过去了， 雨水止住了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;大地百花盛开， 百鸟争鸣的季节已经来临， 田野也传来斑鸠的叫声。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;无花果快成熟了， 葡萄树也开满了花， 散发着阵阵芬芳。 我的爱人，起来吧； 我的佳偶，跟我来。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我的鸽子啊， 你在岩穴中， 在悬崖的隐秘处。 让我看看你的脸， 听听你的声音吧， 因为你的声音温柔， 你的脸庞秀丽。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;为我们抓住狐狸， 抓住破坏葡萄园的小狐狸， 因为我们的葡萄树正在开花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我的良人属于我，我也属于他。 他在百合花间牧放羊群。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我的良人啊， 凉风吹起、日影飞逝的时候， 但愿你快快回来， 就像比特山的羚羊和小鹿一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我夜晚躺在床上， 思念着我心爱的人； 我寻找他，却找不到。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我要起来寻遍城里的街巷和广场， 我要寻找我心爱的人。 我寻找他，却寻不到。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我遇上城中巡逻的守卫， 就问：“你们看到我心爱的人了吗？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我刚离开他们，便找到了我心爱的人。 我拉着他，不让他走； 我把他带回娘家， 到怀我者的卧室。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的少女啊！ 我指着羚羊和田野的母鹿吩咐你们， 不要叫醒或惊动爱情， 等它自发吧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;那像烟柱一样从旷野上来， 散发着商人贩卖的没药、乳香等各样芬芳之气的是什么呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;看啊，是所罗门的轿子， 周围是六十名勇士， 都是以色列的精兵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;他们个个骁勇善战，手持利剑， 腰配战刀，防备夜间的偷袭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;所罗门王用黎巴嫩木为自己造了一顶轿子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;银轿柱、金靠背、紫锦坐垫， 轿里装饰着耶路撒冷少女的爱情。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;锡安的少女啊， 出去看看所罗门王的风采吧！ 他头上的王冠是他母亲在他成婚那天， 在他心中欢乐之日为他戴上的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我的爱人啊，你真美丽！真美丽！ 面纱下的双眸好像鸽子， 你的秀发就好像跃下基列山冈的山羊群。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你的牙齿如同一群新剪了毛、从水里洗净上来的母羊， 成双成对， 一颗也没有脱落。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你的唇好像朱红丝带， 你的口娇美， 你面纱后面的双颊如两瓣石榴。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你的颈项宛若一行行石头建造的大卫楼塔， 上面装饰着一千个勇士的盾牌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你的胸好像一对小鹿， 一对在百合花间吃草的孪生小鹿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我要登上没药山和乳香冈， 直到晚风吹起、日影消逝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我的爱人啊， 你全然美丽，毫无瑕疵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我的新娘啊， 跟我一起离开黎巴嫩， 跟我一起离开黎巴嫩吧！ 离开亚玛拿山顶， 离开示尼珥山和黑门山巅， 离开狮穴和豹山吧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我的妹妹，我的新娘啊， 你夺去了我的心。 你的秋波一闪， 你项链上的明珠， 夺去了我的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我的妹妹，我的新娘啊， 你的爱情多么迷人， 你的爱情比美酒香甜。 你身上膏油的芬芳远胜过一切香料。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我的新娘，你的嘴唇滴蜜， 你的舌头底下藏着奶与蜜。 你衣服散发的香气， 就像黎巴嫩山一样芬芳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我的妹妹，我的新娘， 你是紧锁的园子， 封闭的井，隐藏的泉源。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你好像一个石榴果园， 结满了上好的果子， 还有凤仙花和哪哒树、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;哪哒和番红花、菖蒲和肉桂， 以及各样乳香木、没药、沉香和一切上好的香料。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你是园中的甘泉，是活水的井， 是从黎巴嫩流下来的溪水。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;北风啊，兴起吧！ 南风啊，吹来吧！ 吹向我的园子， 使它的清香四溢。 愿我的良人走进自己的园中， 享受其中的珍果。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我的妹妹，我的新娘啊， 我已经来到自己的园中， 采了我的没药和香料， 品尝了我的蜂房和蜂蜜， 也享用了我的美酒和鲜奶。 朋友们，尽情吃喝吧。 相爱的人啊，沉醉在爱中吧！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我虽然躺在床上，心却清醒。 我听见我的良人叩门，说： “开门吧！我的妹妹，我的爱人， 我完美无瑕的小鸽子啊， 我的头上沾满了露水， 头发被夜间的露珠弄湿了。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;可是我已经脱了衣裳，怎能再穿上呢？ 我已经洗了脚，怎能再沾土呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我的良人从门孔伸进手来， 我的心神随之荡漾，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;就起来为他开门； 我的双手滴下没药， 门闩也沾了我指头滴下的没药。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我为良人开了门， 他却已经离开了。 他的离去使我心中失落。 我到处找他，却找不着； 我呼唤他，却得不到回答。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;城中巡逻的卫兵遇见我， 把我打伤了， 看守城墙的人还抢走了我的披肩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的少女啊， 我恳求你们， 倘若遇见我的良人， 请告诉他我思爱成病。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;绝色佳人啊！ 你的良人与别的男子比较， 究竟有什么长处， 以致你这样恳求我们呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我的良人红光满面， 超越万人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;他头如纯金， 头发像波浪， 黑如乌鸦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;他的眼睛清澈明亮， 如同溪旁用奶洗净的白鸽， 如同镶嵌合适的宝石。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他的双颊芬芳， 犹如种满香草的花圃。 他的嘴唇好像滴着没药汁的百合花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他的双臂如同镶着水苍玉的金杖， 身体如同镶嵌蓝宝石的象牙。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他的双腿好像纯金座上的白玉石柱， 他的容貌像黎巴嫩， 佳美如香柏树。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22005016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;他的嘴甘甜， 整个人都令人爱慕。 耶路撒冷的少女啊， 这就是我的良人， 我的朋友。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;绝色佳人啊， 你的良人去了何处？ 你的良人转往何方？ 我们好帮你寻找他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我的良人下到自己的园中， 在香草花圃中牧放他的羊群， 采集百合花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我属于我的良人， 我的良人也属于我。 他在百合花间牧放羊群。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我的爱人啊， 你像得撒一样秀丽， 像耶路撒冷一样佳美， 像旌旗飘扬的军队一样威严。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;求你把视线移开吧， 因为你的眼波使我迷乱。 你的秀发像从基列山坡下来的山羊群。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你的牙齿如同一群从水里洗净上来的母羊， 成双成对， 一颗也没有脱落。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你面纱后面的双颊如两瓣石榴。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;虽有六十个王后， 八十个妃嫔和无数的宫女，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;但我完美无瑕的小鸽子独一无二， 她是她母亲的独女和最爱。 众女子看见她都夸她有福， 王后和妃嫔见了也连连称赞她，说：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;“这位灿烂似晨光， 皎洁如月亮，明媚如太阳， 亮丽如布满天际之星辰的是谁呢？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我下到核桃园中， 要看看谷中嫩绿的花木， 看看葡萄树是否已发芽， 石榴树是否正在开花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;不知不觉， 我的心把我带到我尊长的车上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022006013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 6:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22006013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;回来吧，回来吧， 书拉密的少女！ 回来吧，回来吧， 好让我们再看看你！ 你们为何目不转睛地看着书拉密的少女， 好像观看玛哈念的舞蹈呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我的公主啊，你的脚配上鞋多么美啊！ 你美玉般圆润的腿是巧匠的杰作。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你的肚脐好像不缺调和酒的圆杯。 你的腰好像被百合花环绕的麦堆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你的胸好像一对小鹿， 一对孪生小鹿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你的脖子宛如象牙塔， 眼睛好像希实本境内巴特·拉并门旁的水池。 你的鼻子好像眺望大马士革的黎巴嫩塔。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你的头高昂如迦密山， 你的秀发好像紫锦， 君王的心被你的缕缕青丝系住。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我的爱人，你是多么美丽， 多么讨人喜爱，令人陶醉啊！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你亭亭玉立如同棕树， 你的胸就像树上的果串。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我要攀上这棕树， 握住树上的果子。 愿你的胸像葡萄串， 你的气息如苹果般清香。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你的亲吻像上好的美酒。 愿美酒流入我良人的口中， 缓缓注入他陶醉的唇齿间。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我属于我的良人， 是他所恋慕的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我的良人，来吧！ 让我们到田间去， 在村庄里住宿吧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我们清晨去葡萄园， 看看葡萄树是否已经发芽开花， 石榴树是否正在开花。 我要在那里把我的爱情献给你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022007013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 7:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22007013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;那里风茄飘香， 门口有各样上好的新陈美果。 我的良人，这都是我为你存留的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;如果你是我的同胞兄弟就好了。 这样，在外头遇见你， 我也可以亲吻你， 没有人会取笑我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我可以把你带进教养我的母亲家。 我要给你喝石榴汁酿的醇酒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;他的左手扶着我的头， 他的右手紧抱着我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的少女啊， 我吩咐你们， 不要叫醒或惊动爱情， 等它自发吧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;那从旷野上来、靠在良人身旁的是谁呢？ 我在苹果树下唤醒你， 你母亲在那里怀你养你， 为你受生产之苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;请把我印在你的心上， 刻在你的手臂上， 因为爱情如死亡一般坚固， 嫉妒像阴间一样残酷， 它燃起的火焰是烧灭一切的烈火。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;爱情，大水不能熄灭， 江河不能淹没。 若有人想倾其家财买爱情， 必遭唾弃。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我们有一个小妹， 她的胸还没有发育。 若有人来提亲， 我们该怎么办？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;她若是墙， 我们要在上面建造银塔； 她若是门， 我们要用香柏木板围护她。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我是一面墙， 我的双乳像城楼， 我在他眼中像找到平安的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;所罗门在巴力·哈们有一个葡萄园， 他把葡萄园租给看守的人， 租金是每人一千块银子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我的葡萄园，我自己作主。 所罗门啊，你的一千块银子自己留着， 二百块银子给管果园的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你这住在园中的人啊， 同伴们都在聆听你的声音， 求你让我也听见吧！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10022008014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅歌 8:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "22008014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我的良人啊， 愿你像香草山上的羚羊和小鹿， 快快来到我身边！</p>"
  }
]